# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent guidance substrate — tracked (operator bind 2026-08-01)
#
# Rules/skills/commands are a common target of agent reasoning; leaving them
# untracked made every cross-seat claim about guidance unverifiable from the
# repo. Tracking here is NOT publication — this repo is private, and the
# pre-publication scrub (operator name, /home/* paths, `jupiter` hostname,
# private MCP host) is tracked separately as a residual.
#
# Life-domain skills stay ignored: they carry real names, probate/APN numbers,
# account identifiers, and psych/relationship material. `.claude/skills/`
# (life seat) remains fully ignored by the `.*` rule above.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.cursor/
.cursor/*
!.cursor/rules/
!.cursor/rules/**
!.cursor/skills/
!.cursor/skills/**
!.cursor/commands/
!.cursor/commands/**

# Life/legal/tax/psych domain — real matters, not engineering guidance
.cursor/skills/tax/
.cursor/skills/lawyer-stance/
.cursor/skills/lawyer-stance-code/
.cursor/skills/psych-framework-counsel/
.cursor/skills/crypto-trading-research/
.cursor/skills/corpus-cross-reference-discipline/
.cursor/skills/case-evidence-retrieval/
.cursor/skills/legal-opinion-corpus-ingestion/
.cursor/skills/w2-ingestion/
.cursor/skills/messages-check/

# Ecosystem plugin SoT — skills, commands, seat overlays (markdown re-included)
!cursor-plugins/**
cursor-plugins/**/.cursor-plugin/